If there's one thing I like more than cake,

256
00:16:48,940 --> 00:16:49,920
it's birthday cake.

257
00:16:50,060 --> 00:16:50,440
Cool.

258
00:16:50,760 --> 00:16:52,220
You guys want to hit the market with me?

259
00:16:52,220 --> 00:16:53,800
Hey, Satoru, Kaio,

260
00:16:54,020 --> 00:16:56,280
I need your help putting these boxes away.

261
00:16:56,440 --> 00:16:56,780
Huh?

262
00:16:57,300 --> 00:16:58,760
Can't it wait till tomorrow?

263
00:17:00,760 --> 00:17:02,160
It sort of figures.

264
00:17:02,820 --> 00:17:05,500
We blew off the last time we had cleaning duties.

265
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:06,680
I guess.

266
00:17:07,360 --> 00:17:08,620
Man, this is heavy.

267
00:17:09,420 --> 00:17:11,200
Some friends they turned out to be.

268
00:17:11,420 --> 00:17:13,520
Those doofuses totally bailed on us.

269
00:17:13,520 --> 00:17:17,720
That'll be 5,000 yen, please.

270
00:17:18,080 --> 00:17:18,460
Okay.

271
00:17:20,740 --> 00:17:21,560
Wait a sec.

272
00:17:22,140 --> 00:17:24,200
It cost 5,000 back then, too.

273
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:28,180
I remember I was so stoked about it being my birthday.

274
00:17:28,420 --> 00:17:29,480
I spent all I had.

275
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:31,820
We made a ton of sandwiches,

276
00:17:32,480 --> 00:17:33,900
but since it was just my mom and me,

277
00:17:34,040 --> 00:17:35,040
we had a lot left over.

278
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:40,480
I'm home!

279
00:17:43,520 --> 00:17:46,280
Ready, and...

280
00:17:46,280 --> 00:17:46,920
Kaio!

281
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:47,920
Satoru!

282
00:17:48,420 --> 00:17:50,260
Happy birthday, guys!

283
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:52,200
Wait.

284
00:17:52,480 --> 00:17:53,740
Mom, you knew about this?

285
00:17:54,060 --> 00:17:55,160
I helped out a little,

286
00:17:55,340 --> 00:17:58,000
but they're the real masterminds behind this evil scheme.

287
00:17:59,260 --> 00:18:00,560
So then today,

288
00:18:01,120 --> 00:18:02,500
those chores were planned, too?

289
00:18:02,860 --> 00:18:03,220
Uh-huh.

290
00:18:03,380 --> 00:18:05,120
We asked Mr. Yoshiro to stall you.

291
00:18:05,760 --> 00:18:08,020
He also told us it was Kaio's birthday today.

292
00:18:08,800 --> 00:18:10,860
I guess our little surprise worked, huh?

293
00:18:11,060 --> 00:18:11,820
Uh, yeah.

294
00:18:11,820 --> 00:18:13,720
Guess what, Kaio?

295
00:18:14,340 --> 00:18:16,920
Satoru insisted on getting a cake just for you.

296
00:18:18,020 --> 00:18:19,720
I'm sorry, Satoru.

297
00:18:20,660 --> 00:18:21,340
I tried,

298
00:18:21,620 --> 00:18:23,780
but I couldn't finish your present in time.

299
00:18:24,180 --> 00:18:24,660
Seriously?

300
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,560
You were making me something?

301
00:18:26,940 --> 00:18:27,400
Mm-hmm.

302
00:18:28,500 --> 00:18:31,060
That's why she wanted to get home early yesterday.

303
00:18:32,180 --> 00:18:33,060
Last night,

304
00:18:33,300 --> 00:18:35,580
I fell asleep before I could finish it.

305
00:18:35,580 --> 00:18:36,860
That's okay.

306
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:38,680
You can give it to me later.

307
00:18:39,620 --> 00:18:40,760
Hey, guys!

308
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:43,940
Let's make 5,000 yen worth of sandwiches!

309
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:44,900
Yeah!

310
00:18:45,280 --> 00:18:45,800
What?

311
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:47,740
You spent all the money!

312
00:18:47,740 --> 00:18:52,200
We all had a blast making those sandwiches together.

313
00:18:52,200 --> 00:18:55,680
But this time,

314
00:18:56,160 --> 00:18:58,300
there weren't any left over at the end of the night.

315
00:18:59,700 --> 00:19:00,720
Friends are the best,

316
00:19:01,040 --> 00:19:01,680
no doubt.

317
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:05,860
Everyone brought presents for Kaio and me.

318
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:07,640
Talk about a haul.

319
00:19:08,700 --> 00:19:09,780
And then...

320
00:19:09,780 --> 00:19:10,780
That's for me!

321
00:19:10,780 --> 00:19:20,860
Thank you, Satoru.

322
00:19:21,760 --> 00:19:23,040
Thank you, everyone.

323
00:19:24,820 --> 00:19:26,760
You can leave the cleaning up to us.

324
00:19:27,020 --> 00:19:28,680
Yeah, walk Kaio home.

325
00:19:30,380 --> 00:19:31,880
It's so cold!

326
00:19:32,140 --> 00:19:32,820
You're an idiot.

327
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:36,920
Good night!

328
00:19:39,500 --> 00:19:40,100
Here.

329
00:19:40,100 --> 00:19:42,520
Thank you for today.

330
00:19:43,180 --> 00:19:45,700
I'm glad I got to be friends with you and the others.

331
00:19:46,900 --> 00:19:48,780
I'll give you your present tomorrow.

332
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:50,080
Promise.

333
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:53,360
Can't wait.

334
00:19:54,740 --> 00:19:55,300
Good night.

335
00:19:55,900 --> 00:19:56,460
Good night.

336
00:19:56,460 --> 00:20:10,960
I did it.

337
00:20:11,540 --> 00:20:12,400
I did it.

338
00:20:12,940 --> 00:20:13,800
It worked.

339
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:16,700
I changed history.

340
00:20:16,700 --> 00:20:26,060
Everyone had left by the time I got home.

341
00:20:27,740 --> 00:20:30,260
I was so exhausted from the past few days,

342
00:20:30,820 --> 00:20:32,980
all that built-up tension finally popped.

343
00:20:32,980 --> 00:20:37,060
I collapsed on my futon and slept like a log.

344
00:20:42,580 --> 00:20:43,600
Son of a bitch!

345
00:20:43,660 --> 00:20:44,080
I'm late!

346
00:20:45,080 --> 00:20:45,960
I'm here, sir!

347
00:20:46,040 --> 00:20:46,380
Sorry!

348
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:47,900
Just in time.

349
00:20:48,260 --> 00:20:49,980
I was about to mark you tardy.

350
00:20:51,980 --> 00:20:52,700
Made it.

351
00:20:53,560 --> 00:20:54,080
Okay.

352
00:20:54,760 --> 00:20:56,400
Does anyone know if Kaio's coming today?

353
00:20:56,400 --> 00:21:11,000
Kaio didn't show up that day.

354
00:21:11,500 --> 00:21:12,380
Or the next one.

355
00:21:13,960 --> 00:21:15,480
And that promise she made me,

356
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:18,120
she never got to keep it.

357
00:21:18,120 --> 00:21:48,100
She never got to keep it.

358
00:21:48,120 --> 00:22:18,100
She never got to keep it.

359
00:22:18,120 --> 00:22:21,600
I was stuck with the air in my heart

360
00:22:21,600 --> 00:22:23,500
The air now full of insecurity

361
00:22:23,500 --> 00:22:23,940
I still needtie

362
00:22:23,940 --> 00:22:25,240
Butter with children

363
00:22:25,240 --> 00:22:27,360
You shall tend to grow

364
00:22:27,360 --> 00:22:28,860
But always growing up

365
00:22:28,860 --> 00:22:29,740
It is something that I put in

366
00:22:29,740 --> 00:22:30,820
The pure Dassault

367
00:22:30,820 --> 00:22:31,800
Say it in front of you

368
00:22:31,800 --> 00:22:33,680
I have something that I talk to you

369
00:22:33,680 --> 00:22:34,120
Cause I show you

370
00:22:34,120 --> 00:22:35,120
I'll be meeting you

371
00:22:35,120 --> 00:22:36,940
But once more

372
00:22:36,940 --> 00:22:38,020
Coming in

373
00:22:38,020 --> 00:22:39,500
This世界

374
00:22:39,500 --> 00:22:41,540
Will you live

375
00:22:41,540 --> 00:22:42,500
With you

376
00:22:42,500 --> 00:22:43,840
I would not like to

377
00:22:43,840 --> 00:22:44,240
whether that student

378
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:44,960
Acadote

379
